{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund the NHS to provide all health-related services free at the point of use",
        "additional_details": "We believe it\u2019s time to recognise the holistic nature of all health aspects, from mental and physical health to elderly care, providing robust services that cover these areas comprehensively.\r\n \r\nSome health services, such as dental and optician care, require fees or private contributions, making them less accessible to many. We believe expanding the NHS to cover these areas comprehensively could ensure that healthcare needs are met equitably across the population.",
        "background": "We demand the Government to provide NHS funding to ensure all services are free to all and are based on clinical need rather than an individual\u2019s ability to pay. We want the NHS to be free at the point of use for all for any medical, mental, age-related, optician and dental services",
